They were already informed and acted on it: :-)
https://support.rstudio.com/hc/communities/public/questions/201046993-Library-dependency-issue-on-Fedora-20-?locale=en-us

The workaround, for the moment, is to update to version available from
http://www.rstudio.com/ide/download/preview

where the problem is fixed.

FWIW, any version above, or equal to, v0.98.836 works.

